WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
[On screen: From chatting to working — Chat naturally · make the current brief · intervene on purpose · checkpoint the work]

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.844
Messaging an AI tool like a friend is not the mistake.

00:00:12.844 --> 00:00:19.067
Conversation is useful when you are still discovering the job.

00:00:19.067 --> 00:00:34.000
The trouble starts when this window is also expected to be the idea box, the brief, the workbench, the review and the permanent record.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:43.333
The old rule was simple: this chat holds the context, and a new chat starts from zero.

00:00:43.333 --> 00:00:51.020
Current tools can carry saved instructions, memory, Project sources and earlier conversations across boundaries.

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:53.765
More information may be available.

00:00:53.765 --> 00:01:02.000
That still does not tell the model which objective, decision or version governs the work.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:04.757
We begin naturally.

00:01:04.757 --> 00:01:16.703
The tool receives one useful request, and the model produces an early draft.

00:01:16.703 --> 00:01:27.730
It fills a gap with app registration because nobody has said otherwise.

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:36.000
That is a plausible start, not the approved plan.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:42.800
Now the real job arrives in pieces.

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:46.686
Each correction is sensible.

00:01:46.686 --> 00:02:01.257
Together, they are easy to misread because the first draft is still sitting underneath them.

00:02:01.257 --> 00:02:10.000
Ten scattered corrections are not automatically one unambiguous assignment.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:12.667
Pause before substantial execution.

00:02:12.667 --> 00:02:18.000
Keep every fact, but name one current authority.

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:26.000
The objective, approved facts, boundaries, outputs and finish line now sit together.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:31.333
We have not written a giant perfect prompt.

00:02:31.333 --> 00:02:40.000
We have turned discovery into a brief the next stage can actually follow.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:41.395
Same tool.

00:02:41.395 --> 00:02:42.791
Same task.

00:02:42.791 --> 00:02:44.186
Same facts.

00:02:44.186 --> 00:02:51.860
One variable changed: the work is organized around the current brief.

00:02:51.860 --> 00:02:59.535
The model no longer has to infer which old message wins.

00:02:59.535 --> 00:03:10.000
We can execute in bounded stages and check each result against the same finish line.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:17.024
The same session is useful while the objective and artifact remain coherent.

00:03:17.024 --> 00:03:21.122
Finish one stage, check it, then continue.

00:03:21.122 --> 00:03:34.000
A new message can revise this work without forcing a new chat, as long as it still serves the same governing brief.

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:39.469
While the run continues, four thoughts arrive.

00:03:39.469 --> 00:03:45.719
Make a poster afterward belongs in the queue.

00:03:45.719 --> 00:03:58.219
Use the venue's approved accessibility wording steers now because the current result depends on it.

00:03:58.219 --> 00:04:09.156
The audience is vendors, not neighbours stops the run because the premise is wrong.

00:04:09.156 --> 00:04:19.312
Why that heading can wait if the answer will not change the deliverable.

00:04:19.312 --> 00:04:24.000
The rule is consequence, not punctuation.

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:29.897
Stay when the objective and main artifact are unchanged.

00:04:29.897 --> 00:04:41.034
Start fresh when a distinct workstream begins or the old session is anchored to the wrong brief.

00:04:41.034 --> 00:04:45.621
Use a clean session for independent review.

00:04:45.621 --> 00:04:52.172
Branch to explore an alternative without overwriting the main line.

00:04:52.172 --> 00:05:02.000
Use a Project when several purposeful sessions need the same scoped home, sources and instructions.

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:06.000
The transcript can explain what happened.

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:10.667
The durable artifact records what is current.

00:05:10.667 --> 00:05:16.667
Save the accepted version, decisions, status and next action.

00:05:16.667 --> 00:05:28.000
Then a new session can resume from a handoff instead of reconstructing the job from confident fragments.

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:28.970
Chat naturally.

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:33.818
Then orient, discover, brief, execute in stages, review and checkpoint.

00:05:33.818 --> 00:05:38.667
Let work finish, queue, steer or stop based on consequence.

00:05:38.667 --> 00:05:44.000
Continue or reset based on the objective and source of truth.

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:50.000
Complete the working brief for one safe job before the next substantial stage.
